the knowledge base and_example includes:

the text of the source program is at "sources/and-example.l4".

can drive if
    the age is a number N
    and N >= 16
    and has license.

all true for a boolean with a second boolean with a third boolean if
    true is equal to the boolean
    and true is equal to the second boolean
    and true is equal to the third boolean.

is eligible if
    the person age is a number N
    and N >= 18
    and the person income is a number M
    and M > 30000
    and it is not the case that has criminal record.

in range for a number N with a number M if
    N >= 0
    and N <= 100
    and M >= 0
    and M <= 100.

passing grade for a score S if
    S >= 60
    and S <= 100.

the access level for an user age U with a boolean is a text if
    U >= 18
    and true is equal to the boolean
    and the text is equal to "full access"
    otherwise the text is equal to "restricted".

